What are Window Blinds?
Window blinds are functional yet stylish window coverings consisting of adjustable slats or panels made from materials like wood, metal, fabric or plastic. Their versatile design allows precise light control and privacy management through mechanisms ranging from simple manual operation to advanced smart home automation. Beyond basic functionality, modern blinds have evolved into design elements that enhance interior aesthetics while offering practical benefits like UV protection and energy savings.
